flowchart TD
    Start([User clicks Download file]) --> V1{Valid peer & safe filename?}
    V1 -- No --> Fail1[Log FAILED history & throw IOException]
    V1 -- Yes --> V2{Destination already exists?}
    V2 -- Yes --> Fail1
    V2 -- No --> Temp[Create unique peershare-*.part temp file]
    Temp --> Net[Send DOWNLOAD & stream 8KB chunks + SHA-256]
    Net --> V3{Complete, EOF & SHA-256 match?}
    V3 -- No / Cancelled --> Clean[Log FAILED history & delete .part]
    V3 -- Yes --> Link[Files.createLink destination, tempFile]
    Link --> V4{Link succeeded?}
    V4 -- No --> Clean
    V4 -- Yes --> Hist[Insert SUCCESS in download_history]
    Hist --> DelPart[finally: delete .part temp file]
    DelPart --> Done([Show Saved confirmation])
